cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AnaMorf in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "AnaMorf: analysis of filamentous microbe morphology"
abstract: "AnaMorf is an ImageJ/Fiji plugin for automated analysis of the morphology of filamentous structures (e.g. fungal hyphae). From a directory of images it segments and traces each object and reports projected area, circularity, total length, endpoints, branchpoints, hyphal growth unit, lacunarity, box-counting and Fourier fractal dimensions, and curvature."
type: software
